    "description": "# RF-15c: \"Log Referral\" Button — Confirm Behavior\n\n_Client question — confirm what this mockup action is actually supposed to do before building anything._\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Do not build a button or logic for this feature. The client has confirmed it is not needed.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: raised in the Aug 24 Kobi/Taryn Weekly Planning sync. The Referrer Record User Stories doc (RF-15) originally described this action as creating a new Referral record, pre-filled from RF-3's defaults; Referral is not a separate object anywhere else in this build. The client's confirmation that the feature isn't needed resolves that open question.\n* Same page as the Primary/Secondary Referrals related lists.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* Aug 24 Kobi/Taryn Weekly Planning — [transcript](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qB7cUeJGFs_SZba9NX5R9MWKzOj8yTetmWTWoqY3gw8/edit), verified.\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-198 — Referrer: Primary Referrals Related List](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693253886041/f/), [BUILD-199 — Referrer: Secondary Referrals Related List](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693110159799/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-24 from the Aug 24 Kobi/Taryn Weekly Planning sync.\n\n",
